# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in a real value before deploying.
# Nothing below is a working credential — the site runs and looks correct
# without it, but the booking form (BookingForm.tsx) and contact form
# (ContactForm.tsx) will log a warning and no-op instead of storing the lead.

# --- Booking + contact form lead capture ---
# A Google Apps Script web app deployment URL — see
# google-apps-script/Code.gs in the Cure Infertility repo for the receiving
# script. It stores each submission into a "Book Appointment" sheet tab
# (this site only ever sends form_type: "book_appointment_infertility",
# the same shape thecureinfertility.com's own booking forms send). Storage
# only — no email is sent by that script.
#
# Point this at the same Apps Script deployment as thecureinfertility.com
# to land both sites' bookings in one shared spreadsheet, or deploy your own
# copy of Code.gs against a separate spreadsheet if you'd rather keep this
# site's leads apart.
NEXT_PUBLIC_APPOINTMENT_FORM_SHEET_URL=
